;    1: TDecorate(count=16, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=749, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=10, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=11195903, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=933, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=835, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hmm hmm hmmm."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> talking something over, just the two of them... What could it be about?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Something they can't even tell me...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, I shouldn't go reading into it. Everyone has a secret or two.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not that I have any secrets in particular.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Feeling good is wonderful! Maybe I'll take a little stroll on the way!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was April, and I felt refreshed! The weather was glorious!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Not quite: the sky was cloudy, unfortunately.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But it didn't look like rain, so I'd take my time walking there.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\なつみ追跡.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">It's been a while since I've walked down the street like this in April.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Once in a while I have a good day even in April, but mostly I'm wiped out.</STYLE><PG>
"Hm?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Voices, from somewhere behind me.</STYLE><PG>
"Just my imagination?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There was no one in sight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Now that it's spring and animals are getting lively, maybe even birds or cats crying sound like people?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But come to think of it, there was a murder in this town today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ugh, now I've remembered something nasty. Let's hurry up and finish the shopping.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\コンビニ店内.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Let's see, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can't do without a Super Soda Bomber, and for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, plain soda should be fine.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We're ordering pizza after this, so we don't need many snacks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For now, a Gateau Pie should do.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\なつみ追跡.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Okay, now I just need to bring the DVDs from home and we're good.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Hm? But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said she'd go to cram school after an hour, didn't she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The way things look, is she planning to stay at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s place the whole time?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s talking something over with her. Maybe it's connected to that?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Oh, come to think of it...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A few years ago, I ran into </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> on her way back from the hospital, didn't I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both told me that's not the kind of thing you should push someone to tell you.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe that's what they're talking about now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Hmm, but the only time </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has seemed unwell was when she had an upset stomach the day before yesterday...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> are both a little strange today.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, me feeling good today is kind of strange too, in a way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And a murder, here in Motoki-cho...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I'm overthinking it, overthinking it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> probably has things that are hard to tell me of all people, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> decided to skip cram school to talk them over with her. That must be it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ugh, I'm hungry! I've got to get them to order the pizza soon!</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------